{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21041","headline":"感讽六首 四 · 李贺","name":"感讽六首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青门放弹去，马色连空郊。\n何年帝家物，玉装鞍上摇。\n去去走犬归，来来坐烹羔。\n千金不了馔，狢肉称盘臊。\n试问谁家子，乃老能佩刀。\n西山白盖下，贤儁寒萧萧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21041.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21041","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}